<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="top-banner"><div class="top-banner-inner">스포츠디비 — 스포츠를 더 즐겁고 가깝게</div></div>
  <header>
    <div class="header-container">
      <a href="/" class="logo">
        <img src="/logo.png" alt="SportsDB" class="logo-img">
      </a>
      <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="메뉴 열기">
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
    <nav id="mainNav">
      <ul class="tab-nav">
        <li><a href="/" class="tab-link <%= activeTab === 'home' ? 'active' : '' %>">🏠 홈</a></li>
        <li><a href="/sportsdb" class="tab-link <%= activeTab === 'sportsdb' ? 'active' : '' %>"><img src="/favicon.png" class="nav-icon" alt=""> SportsDB</a></li>
        <li><a href="/press" class="tab-link <%= activeTab === 'press' ? 'active' : '' %>">📰 보도자료</a></li>
        <li><a href="/youtube" class="tab-link <%= activeTab === 'youtube' ? 'active' : '' %>">🎬 유튜브</a></li>
        <li><a href="/articles" class="tab-link <%= activeTab === 'articles' ? 'active' : '' %>">🏟️ 기사</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>
